[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0072","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0072.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1348","title":"W3M IMG标签ALT属性跨站脚本攻击（XSS）漏洞","description":"w3m 是一款基于文本模式的网页浏览器，其 0.3.2.2 之前版本在处理 IMG 标签的 ALT 属性时存在跨站脚本攻击（XSS）漏洞。由于程序未对 IMG 标签 ALT 属性中的 HTML 标签进行正确转义过滤，远程攻击者可通过构造包含恶意 IMG 标签的特制网页，诱使用户使用 w3m 访问该页面，从而在用户浏览器上下文中执行任意脚本代码，导致敏感信息泄露（如 Cookie 或本地文件）。该漏洞影响范围广泛，攻击条件简单，仅需用户访问恶意页面即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1348"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-02-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:08.977","remediation":"升级 w3m 至 0.3.2.2 或更高版本。Debian 系统执行 `apt-get update && apt-get install w3m`，Red Hat 系统执行 `up2date w3m` 或通过 Red Hat Network 安装更新。如无法升级，在 w3m 配置文件 `/etc/w3m/w3mconfig` 或 `~/.w3m/config` 中禁用 frame 支持（`display_frame 0`），并避免使用 `-F` 参数启动 w3m。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104552193927323&w=2","http://sourceforge.net/project/shownotes.php?release_id=126233","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-249","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-250","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-251","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/11266.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-044.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-045.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6794","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1348.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1348","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1348.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1348.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c91b667a34faaae3b0a33048a22e9eae624cf0e4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fgpf-gj3f-wvmc/GHSA-fgpf-gj3f-wvmc.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2003-045.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1404.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-250.nasl","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/D/debian_DSA-249.nasl","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2003/dsa-250.data"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0072.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0072.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0091","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0091.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1403","title":"dhcpcd DHCP 客户端守护进程本地代码执行漏洞","description":"dhcpcd DHCP 客户端守护进程 1.3.22 及更早版本中存在 shell 元字符注入漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 dhcpd 的 .info 脚本中注入特制的 shell 元字符，这些字符随后被传递至 .exe 脚本执行，从而以 dhcpcd 进程权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 dhcpcd 1.3.22 及之前版本，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1403"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-01-17T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:15.940","remediation":"升级 dhcpcd 至 1.3.17pl2-8.1 或更高版本（Debian 已发布 DSA-219 安全更新），可从 security.debian.org 获取更新包。如无法升级，建议移除 dhcpcd 的 setuid 权限或限制本地用户对 dhcpcd 脚本目录的写入权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000549","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104189546709447&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-219","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:003","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6200","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10663","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1403.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1403","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1403.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1403.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cjv5-r44f-hxgj/GHSA-cjv5-r44f-hxgj.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-219.nasl","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2002/dsa-219.data","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_146700_146800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1403.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8c236951-a606-419a-a96a-13aa0413fd6c.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0091.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0090","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0090.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1395","title":"Debian Internet Message 以不安全方式创建临时文件漏洞","description":"Debian Internet Message (IM) 141-18 及更早版本在创建临时文件和目录时使用了可预测的名称，本地攻击者可通过预测临时文件路径，利用 impwagent 组件创建的临时目录获取未授权的目录权限，或通过 immknmz 组件覆盖和创建任意文件，导致权限提升或敏感信息泄露。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，但需要本地访问权限，影响 Debian 系统上运行的 Internet Message 服务。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1395"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-01-17T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:14.957","remediation":"升级 Internet Message (IM) 软件包至修复版本：Debian 用户升级至 im-141-18.1 或更高版本（参考 DSA-202），Red Hat Linux 用户通过 up2date 安装 RHSA-2003:038 提供的更新包。如无法立即升级，限制本地不可信用户登录系统，并避免在多用户环境下使用 impwagent 和 immknmz 工具。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/8166","http://secunia.com/advisories/8242","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-202","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10766.php","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10767.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-039.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6307","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1395.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1395","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1395.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1395.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-202.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3b3e0c6dace1e53ea2fb8cc49db3e38b834c9179/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gr6m-v99r-wg6v/GHSA-gr6m-v99r-wg6v.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2003-038.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x7000/6307/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1395.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e385c631-2b85-4f60-b34e-5030e258c0e2.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0090.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0089","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0089.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1392","title":"MGetty faxspool 传真缓冲目录本地权限提升漏洞","description":"mgetty 1.1.29 之前版本中的 faxspool 组件使用了全局可写的缓冲目录来存储待发送传真文件，本地攻击者可通过向该目录写入恶意文件或修改现有传真文件，从而篡改传真传输权限或干扰传真发送流程。该漏洞影响 mgetty 1.1.29 之前的所有版本，攻击者需具有本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。建议升级至 mgetty 1.1.29 或更高版本以修复此问题。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1392"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-01-17T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:14.527","remediation":"升级 mgetty 至 1.1.29 或更高版本。Red Hat Linux 用户可安装 RHSA-2003:008 提供的更新包；Mandrake Linux 用户可安装 MDKSA-2003:053 提供的更新包。如无法立即升级，可手动将传真假脱机目录（通常为 /var/spool/fax）的权限从 0777 修改为 0755，并确保目录所有者设为 fax 用户，以阻止本地非授权用户篡改传真传输。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105154413326136&w=2","http://search.alphanet.ch/cgi-bin/search.cgi?msgid=20021125142338.E12094%40greenie.muc.de&max_results=1&type=long&domain=ml-mgetty","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-008.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-036.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7302","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/11070","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1392.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1392","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1392.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1392.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5965518125739d48e98f0cf3efbf7359253ff7cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-f5rc-6j65-w2pp/GHSA-f5rc-6j65-w2pp.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2003-008.nasl","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mandrake_MDKSA-2003-053.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_146700_146800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1392.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x8000/7302/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0089.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0088","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0088.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1391","title":"mgetty cnd-program 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"mgetty 1.1.29 之前版本中的 cnd-program 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含超长 CallerName 参数的 Caller ID 字符串触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，进而造成拒绝服务，甚至可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响运行 mgetty 服务的各类 Unix/Linux 系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1391"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-01-17T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:14.413","remediation":"升级 mgetty 至 1.1.30 或更高版本。Red Hat 用户可通过 RHSA-2003:008 更新（执行 up2date 命令），Mandrake 用户安装 MDKSA-2003:053 提供的 mgetty-1.1.30-1.1mdk 包。如无法升级，可在 modem 配置中禁用 Caller ID 处理功能（注释或移除 cnd-program 配置行）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105154413326136&w=2","http://search.alphanet.ch/cgi-bin/search.cgi?msgid=20021125142338.E12094%40greenie.muc.de&max_results=1&type=long&domain=ml-mgetty","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-008.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-036.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7303","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/11072","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1391.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1391","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1391.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1391.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0b54eddb6b01c4a2bdae016ba668128b1a8b9336/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-pvpx-24h7-j848/GHSA-pvpx-24h7-j848.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2003-008.nasl","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mandrake_MDKSA-2003-053.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_146700_146800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1391.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x8000/7303/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0088.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0087","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0087.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1390","title":"GeneWeb 4.09之前版本守护进程路径处理不当导致任意文件读取漏洞","description":"GeneWeb 4.09 之前版本的守护进程（daemon）在处理请求路径时存在路径遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造包含特殊字符（如 \"../\"）的恶意 URL，绕过路径限制读取服务器上任意文件，导致系统敏感信息泄露。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，仅需发送特制 HTTP 请求即可利用，影响范围涵盖 GeneWeb 4.09 之前的所有版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1390"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-01-17T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:14.300","remediation":"立即将 GeneWeb 升级至 4.09 或更高版本（该版本于 2002 年 12 月 30 日发布，修复了路径处理不当导致的任意文件读取漏洞）。Debian 用户应参考 DSA-223 安全公告安装对应更新。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或防火墙层面限制对 GeneWeb 守护进程（gwd）的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，并避免将 GeneWeb 暴露在公网。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://cristal.inria.fr/~ddr/GeneWeb/en/version/4.09.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-223","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6549","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/11021","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1390.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1390.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1390","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1390.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1390.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/375cadc04f272885b5b806a51aaff0f00770b97f/2002/CVE-2002-1390.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b80121dc73e23dd13187ec16e91cd79074cff1b7/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-13xx/CVE-2002-1390.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/adb0abfbea757d46e846ba7d3640d43b01b979fe/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1390.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1390.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1390.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0087.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0086","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0086.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1389","title":"typespeed 缓冲区溢出本地权限提升漏洞","description":"typespeed 0.4.2 及更早版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向程序提交超长输入触发栈溢出，导致权限提升。该漏洞影响 typespeed 全系列低版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低，成功利用后可获取与目标进程相同的用户权限，进而执行任意代码或控制系统。建议用户升级至最新版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1389"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-01-02T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:14.200","remediation":"建议立即升级 typespeed 至 0.4.3 或更高版本（已修复该缓冲区溢出），Debian 用户可通过 apt 安装 DSA-217 安全更新包。若无法升级，请卸载 typespeed 或移除其 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/games/typespeed）以阻断本地提权路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-217","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6485","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10936","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1389.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1389","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1389.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1389.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/939814c958d14a0bcaf2639e41afe118cdb5f74c/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xcgq-fw72-gpjp/GHSA-xcgq-fw72-gpjp.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-217.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1389.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_146700_146800.json","https://github.com/entrysky/mageni/blob/c58dcc9bc43b7fb267bb10a8083ada356fbc81d1/plugins/2008/deb_217_1.nasl","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0086.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0085","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0085.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1388","title":"MHonArc HTML 邮件归档跨站脚本漏洞","description":"MHonArc 邮件归档工具 2.5.13 及之前版本存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向邮件列表发送包含恶意 HTML 代码的邮件，当 MHonArc 处理并生成 Web 归档页面时，未对邮件内容中的 HTML 标签进行充分过滤，导致恶意脚本在用户浏览器中执行。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞，影响所有使用 MHonArc 生成邮件归档的网站。升级至 2.5.14 版本可修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1388"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-01-02T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:14.087","remediation":"升级 MHonArc 至 2.6.18 或更高版本（官网最新为 2.6.19），该版本修复了 HTML 过滤器的 XSS 漏洞。Debian 用户应升级至 2.5.2-1.3 或更新版本。如无法立即升级，可在 MHonArc 配置中启用 `TEXTAREAS` 或 `MIMEFILTERS` 过滤 HTML 邮件内容，将不可信来源的 HTML 邮件转为纯文本显示作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-221","http://www.mhonarc.org/archive/cgi-bin/mesg.cgi?a=mhonarc-users&i=200212220120.gBM1K8502180%40mcguire.earlhood.com","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6479","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10950","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-1388.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1388.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1388","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2002.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1388.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1388.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0f14531dae9947fef349fa696ac83d6fc56f601e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jj32-64ww-6673/GHSA-jj32-64ww-6673.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-221.nasl","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2003/dsa-221.data","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7176a127-21f1-4346-bcca-d2e509f0274f.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0085.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0084","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0084.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1384","title":"Xpdf pdftops 整数溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"Xpdf 中的 pdftops 工具（版本 2.01 及更早版本）以及 CUPS 1.1.18 之前版本存在整数溢出漏洞。当解析 PDF 文件中的 ColorSpace 条目时，若该条目包含大量元素，程序在处理过程中会发生整数溢出，导致堆缓冲区溢出。本地攻击者可通过构造特制的 PDF 文件，诱骗目标用户使用 pdftops 或 CUPS 的 PDF 打印功能打开该文件，从而触发漏洞，实现以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Xpdf 2.01 及更早版本、xpdf-i 以及 CUPS 1.1.18 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1384"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-01-02T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:13.617","remediation":"升级 xpdf 至 2.01-2 及以上版本，或升级 CUPS 至 1.1.18 及以上版本。Debian 系统可安装 DSA-222（xpdf）和 DSA-232（CUPS）对应更新包。如无法立即升级，可限制本地用户对 pdftops 工具的访问权限，或禁用 CUPS 的 PDF 打印功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104152282309980&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-222","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-226","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-232","http://www.idefense.com/advisory/12.23.02.txt","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:001","http://www.