2002-0108","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0108.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1697","title":"VTun VTun 2.0-2.5 ECB模式弱加密信息泄露漏洞","description":"VTun 2.0 至 2.5 版本使用电子密码本（ECB）模式加密，该模式采用弱加密算法导致相同明文块产生相同密文块，远程攻击者可通过分析密文模式推断明文内容，从而窃取敏感信息。该漏洞影响 VTun 2.0 至 2.5 所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需权限和用户交互，机密性影响高。攻击者仅需拦截或监听加密隧道流量，通过分析相同密文块模式即可推断明文内容，无需特殊权限或用户交互即可实施被动窃听攻击获取敏感数据。VTun 官方已在后续版本中修复该弱加密模式问题，建议升级至修复版本或改用更安全的加密模式（如 CBC、CTR 等）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1697"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-12-31T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:48.237","remediation":"升级到 VTun 2.6 或更高版本，停止使用 ECB 模式加密；如果无法立即升级，请修改配置文件将加密模式改为 CBC 或指定更安全的算法；同时限制网络访问权限以防止远程攻击者获取敏感信息。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/bugtraq/2002/Jan/0119.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3845","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7904","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1697.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1697","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1697.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1697.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qf69-w3gw-8mx3/GHSA-qf69-w3gw-8mx3.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_400_500.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1697.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--59a5bb82-4312-4537-9408-1f2e2ffc7e9d.json","https://github.com/AlvaroAFdez/Puesta-en-Produccion-Segura-Ciberseguridad/blob/51447ea79c54959529f059e08c13f187be916dd7/labs/L4/README_L4.md","https://github.com/ws-researcher/CAEA/blob/098ddb07c83845feda3d1b1d56ef634927954af4/KGA/dataSet/ICNS/entN_ids_1"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0108.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0107","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0107.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1653","title":"Farm9 Cryptcat 加密连接绕过漏洞","description":"Farm9 Cryptcat 是一款支持加密的网络工具，当其以服务器模式配合 `-e` 参数启动时存在设计缺陷，未能按预期启用加密功能。这导致客户端与服务器之间的通信实际以明文传输，违背了加密配置的安全意图。攻击者可通过网络嗅探方式窃听通信链路，获取传输中的敏感信息（如口令、会话令牌等）。攻击条件简单，只需攻击者能够访问通信链路即可实施，无需认证，属中等危害等级的信息泄露漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1653"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-12-31T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:43.700","remediation":"建议立即停止使用 cryptcat 服务端模式的 -e 加密选项，改用 SSH、stunnel 或 TLS 隧道等成熟加密工具替代。如必须使用 cryptcat，请升级至社区维护版本（如 cryptcat 1.10+）或改用 netcat 配合 OpenSSL 实现加密通信。若无法替换，请在网络层面部署 IPsec/VPN 隔离通信链路，禁止明文端口直接暴露公网。建议升级至 cryptcat 1.10 版本或使用 netcat-openbsd 配合 stunnel 实现加密传输，并在防火墙层面限制仅允许加密隧道端口通信。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/165099","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/8431","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10618","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1653.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1653","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1653.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1653.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2002/CVE-2002-1653","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rw3w-c7r4-m22q/GHSA-rw3w-c7r4-m22q.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1653.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_149600_149700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--1834f0b3-2885-45cd-a58c-0835106c1431.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--1834f0b3-2885-45cd-a58c-0835106c1431.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0107.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0083","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0083.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1383","title":"Common Unix Printing System (CUPS) 整数溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"CUPS（Common Unix Printing System）1.1.14 至 1.1.17 版本中存在多处整数溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过两种途径利用该漏洞：一是向 CUPS 守护进程的 HTTP 接口发送特制请求触发溢出，二是通过 CUPS 过滤器处理恶意构造的图像文件导致内存破坏。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程执行任意代码，完全控制目标系统。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，影响 Linux/Unix 系统上部署的 CUPS 打印服务。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1383"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-12-26T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:13.460","remediation":"立即升级 CUPS 至 1.1.18 或更高版本，该版本修复了 HTTP 接口和图像处理代码中的整数溢出漏洞。如无法升级，可在 CUPS 配置文件 /etc/cups/cupsd.conf 中限制远程访问，将 Listen 绑定到 127.0.0.1:631 仅允许本地访问，并在防火墙中阻断外部对 631 端口的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q4/0117.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104032149026670&w=2","http://secunia.com/advisories/7756/","http://secunia.com/advisories/7794","http://secunia.com/advi