ftware Products CUPS 文件描述符未正确释放拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Common Unix Printing System (CUPS) 1.1.14 至 1.1.17 版本中存在文件描述符管理缺陷，未正确检查各类文件操作和套接字操作的返回值，导致文件描述符被分配后无法正常释放。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送特制请求持续消耗系统文件描述符资源，最终造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux/Unix 系统上部署的 CUPS 打印服务，攻击复杂度低，利用工具 fanta 已公开验证。厂商建议升级至 CUPS 1.1.18 及以上版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1372"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-12-26T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:11.930","remediation":"升级 CUPS 至 1.1.18 或更高版本。Debian 用户应安装 DSA-232 安全更新，Red Hat 用户应用 RHSA-2002:295 补丁，Mandrake 用户安装 MDKSA-2003:001 更新。如无法立即升级，可在 CUPS 配置文件 /etc/cups/cupsd.conf 中限制监听地址为 127.0.0.1，禁止远程访问 CUPS 服务以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q4/0117.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000702","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104032149026670&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-232","http://www.idefense.com/advisory/12.19.02.txt","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:001","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2003_002_cups.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-295.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6440","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10912","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-1372.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1372.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1372","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1372.json","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2002.txt","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1372.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/711263a5c057385b05d3b3d477c7a317d9a9f37f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pj56-w5gq-p5wr/GHSA-pj56-w5gq-p5wr.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mandrake_MDKSA-2003-001.nasl","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/suse_SA_2003_002.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_600_700.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0080.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0079","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0079.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1371","title":"CUPS GIF 图像处理远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Common Unix Printing System (CUPS) 1.1.14 至 1.1.17 版本的 filters/image-gif.c 组件在处理 GIF 图像时未正确校验零长度 GIF 图像的 chunk 头部，存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标 CUPS 服务发送特制的恶意 GIF 图像触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Linux/Unix 系统中运行 CUPS 1.1.14-1.1.17 版本的设备，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。厂商已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1371"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-12-26T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:11.790","remediation":"立即升级 CUPS 至 1.1.18 或更高版本。各发行版对应操作：Red Hat 安装 RHSA-2002:295 更新包；Debian 安装 DSA-232 更新包；SuSE 安装 2003-002 更新包；Mandrake 安装 MDKSA-2003:001 更新包。如无法升级，可在 CUPS 配置中禁用 GIF 图像过滤支持，或在网络层面限制对 CUPS 服务（默认端口 631）的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q4/0117.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000702","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104032149026670&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-232","http://www.idefense.com/advisory/12.19.02.txt","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:001","http://www.novell.