ion":"CUPS（Common Unix Printing System）1.1.14 至 1.1.17 版本的 jobs.c 文件在处理选项字符串时未正确使用 strncat 函数调用，导致存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 CUPS 服务发送特制的打印任务请求触发该漏洞，造成缓冲区溢出，进而实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响运行 CUPS 的各类 Unix/Linux 系统，CVSS v2.0 评分为 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者无需任何认证即可远程利用，且能完全控制目标系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1369"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-12-26T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:11.630","remediation":"立即升级 CUPS 至 1.1.18 或更高版本。Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2002:295 提供的更新包；Debian 用户安装 DSA-232 提供的 cupsys 更新包；SuSE 用户安装 SuSE-SA:2003:002 更新；Mandrake 用户安装 MDKSA-2003:001 更新。如无法立即升级，可在 CUPS 配置文件 cupsd.conf 中限制远程访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接 631 端口，并禁用 Job 选项中的危险参数传递。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q4/0117.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000702","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104032149026670&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-232","http://www.idefense.com/advisory/12.19.02.txt","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:001","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2003_002_cups.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-295.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6438","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10910","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-1369.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1369.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1369","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1369.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9a63d131cc61df62c077c7700617ad6343ec52ef/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6q7q-pxq9-gvhp/GHSA-6q7q-pxq9-gvhp.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a22